            MJT.width(ctx, str, opts)            (same layout, no drawing)
   SVG:     MJT.svgLabel(tex, px)  → a nested <svg> (MathJax output) for SVG figures
   HTML:    use $…$ in the string and typeset the element (mj / MathJax.typesetPromise).
